{# ===========================================================================
   Icon sprite.

   The brand icons, traced from the October 2025 guidelines sheet. Emitted once
   per page as <symbol> definitions; every appearance is a <use href="#i-name">,
   so an icon used eighteen times in the locations field ships its path data
   once instead of eighteen times.

   Inline, never <img>: the symbols carry no fill of their own, so `fill:
   currentColor` on the <use> site inherits the surrounding text color, which is
   what makes one icon work on cream, on the red field, and inside a card.

   INCOMPLETE. The full library is 32 icons. These are the 12 that
   _reference/tajima-home-v2.html inlines, extracted from it because no vector
   source exists anywhere in the repo. The remaining 20 have to come from
   outside before the menu and interior pages, which call for icons the
   prototype never uses. See the Phase 3 report.

   To add one: drop a <symbol id="i-name" viewBox="..."> fragment into
   src/_includes/icons/ and add a line below.
   =========================================================================== #}
<svg class="icon-sprite" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  {% include "icons/broth-pot.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/chili.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/chopsticks-noodles.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/egg.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/garlic.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/naruto-small.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/naruto.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/noodle-wordmark.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/onigiri.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/ramen-bowl.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/steam.svg" %}
  {% include "icons/toppings.svg" %}
</svg>
